stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> New
  New --> Introduced : First visual/audio exposure
  Introduced --> Understood : Correct gist with support
  Understood --> RecallReady : Oral recall attempt
  RecallReady --> InReview : First spaced interval
  InReview --> InReview : Due review
  InReview --> TransferVerified : Novel situation + audio/speech success
  InReview --> RecallReady : Speaking retrieval failure
  InReview --> Understood : Meaning failure
  InReview --> Introduced : Major recognition breakdown
  TransferVerified --> InReview : Later maintenance or failure
